# Canonical identities for `git shortlog`, `git log` and anything that reads them.
#
# There is deliberately NO entry mapping a personal address here. An earlier version
# of this file carried one, which was self-defeating: a mailmap has to contain an
# address in order to rewrite it, so "hide my email" and "list my email in a tracked
# file" cannot both be true. The address was removed from the commit metadata itself
# instead, so there is nothing left to map.
#
# What remains is worth stating, because it is not about privacy: automation should
# not be counted as a human contributor. `Ava (auto-sync)` is this repo's own
# pre-commit hook regenerating diagrams — the project writing to itself — and reading
# it as an author overstates how many people have worked on this.
#
# Format: <canonical name and email> <email to rewrite>

Ava (auto-sync) <ava@localhost> <ava@localhost>
dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
